            <ArticleTitle>Intra-articular fibrous band of the ankle: an uncommon cause of post-traumatic ankle pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>591-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of an intra-articular fibrous band of the ankle is presented with emphasis on the MR imaging appearances. This entity is an important but uncommon cause of post-traumatic ankle pain and is well recognized within the arthroscopy literature, but there is little if any documentation of this condition in the imaging literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
